82
00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:13.409
And then we can control one,

83
00:03:13.409 --> 00:03:16.409
the amount happening here with our subsurface

84
00:03:17.689 --> 00:03:19.610
Fresnel index control,

85
00:03:19.610 --> 00:03:22.550
as well as our overall thickness.

86
00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:24.129
So we can brighten this up.

87
00:03:24.129 --> 00:03:26.530
And remember you can adjust this any way you want.

88
00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:28.969
Notice when I control the opacity

89
00:03:28.969 --> 00:03:31.050
