90
00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:32.669
for the subsurface control,

91
00:03:32.669 --> 00:03:35.169
I can really wash out the detail

92
00:03:35.169 --> 00:03:37.949
and make it look like a lots of light is coming through

93
00:03:37.949 --> 00:03:39.650
or I can limit it such a way

94
00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:41.349
so it looks a little more flatter.

95
00:03:41.349 --> 00:03:44.490
It's up to me and these items all let me to do,

96
00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.689
allow me to do that.

97
00:03:45.689 --> 00:03:50.259
So I'll do control Z a couple of times,

