00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:28.680
obviously the light's really bright,

166
00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:31.439
but you get kind of that cool look and feel

167
00:06:31.439 --> 00:06:35.399
that you can really sell that this looks like jade.

168
00:06:35.399 --> 00:06:36.949
Pretty sweet.

169
00:06:36.949 --> 00:06:38.790
And we also have the color for that too.

170
00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:40.829
So you can really specialize this

171
00:06:40.829 --> 00:06:43.389
