172
00:06:43.389 --> 00:06:45.529
Ooh, almost like a waxy effect.

173
00:06:45.529 --> 00:06:46.370
That's pretty cool.

174
00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:48.149
And a yellow looks pretty great too.

