00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:48.259
You see that right there, right around this pocket

197
00:07:48.259 --> 00:07:50.379
between the one and the other one.

198
00:07:50.379 --> 00:07:52.779
The other ones, it just kind of does it like we're in three

