217
00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:39.139
So we're just faking it as we do this,

218
00:08:39.139 --> 00:08:41.100
as we mess with these parameters.

219
00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:43.620
And again, as you mess with it, as I lower it,

